{"sba-keyaki-13104":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは ♪ "},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日はクリスマス🎅🎄🎁"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クリスマスっていいよねぇ☺️\n子供の頃に戻りたい(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎年姉と妹と一緒に\n物置きのおくぅ〜の方から\n大きいクリスマスツリーを出して\n飾り付けとかした記憶があります💭"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして大好きなカートゥンネットワークを\n24時間つけっぱなしで流してました(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この時期のカートゥンネットワーク\n可愛いんですよね凄く(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんも素敵なクリスマスを\n過ごしてくださいね✨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃあこの前のMステスーパーライブの\n時の写真はっておくね🤳"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYJTJVNEMYWJSDPRQCAQSD5","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆいぽん可愛いッッ😍😍😍"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYJTKTPPHW31D3ED6K9FMVR","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんまにあおたんって可愛いよね☺️妹みたいでほんと可愛い☺️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYJTMY0SZB8Z6VQTA7AX5SY","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"りなたそとゴーちゃん💕"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はここまで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後までお読みいただきありがとうございました🍊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なな"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-33468":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は・"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/07/22/1359314/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てぃすの\nHappy Birthday"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/07/22/1359314/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/07/22/1359314/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/07/22/1359314/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前ね、\nひなとかりんちゃんで\n早めのお祝いをやったよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/07/22/1359314/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆっちゃんが\nほしいゆってた\nおっきいスヌーピーをあげた٩(｡•ω•｡)﻿و\nめっちゃ喜んでくれてよかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも\n元気でうるさいゆうりでいてね笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆうりに全部ぜんぶ\n相談しているため\n私のここ2、3年のすべての感情と行動を知っているんじゃないのかとも思ってしまうくらい、、聞き上手なので、人間不信に陥りやすい私が話せる数少ない人間～(多分人類で3人しかいない)、メールとか連絡を人ととるのが苦手なのに何かあると自分からすぐ連絡しちゃう・唯一。。ここまで同じ人と一緒にいたことないので大切な存在でしかない・これからもよろしく～٩(｡•ω•｡)﻿و☆☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野もおめぴち☆☆☆☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/07/22/1359314/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/07/22/1359314/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のぎ天の\n収録してきたっ٩(｡•ω•｡)﻿و\nキャンプロケ！ぜひみてね～・\n頑張ったよえへへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前の\nのぎ天で楽屋の席の話したやつをみてくれて\nわざわざずーが\nあの話面白かった～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/07/22/1359314/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って連絡くれたの٩(｡•ω•｡)﻿و嬉しかった！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーから\nそういうの言われるとうれしいね！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/07/22/1359314/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近は純奈に\nくっつき虫"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/07/22/1359314/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一枚目は、\nじゅんなの腕に上に寝てる図"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二枚目は、\nみんなで話してる時\nじゅんなの背中にはりつく図"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとね、\nみり愛にあたりつよくいくのブーム。\n無邪気な目でみてくるから\n死んだ目でこれから私をみなさい！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/07/22/1359314/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と指導してる(どんなだよ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、\nあやねちゃんを笑わせ隊。\nじゅんなとかみり愛といると\n絶対あやねちゃんもくっついてくる！(可愛い)\nあやねちゃんを笑わせようと頑張ってる。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/07/22/1359314/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/07/22/1359314/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かりん様は\n仲良し！(シンプルに)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いおりは\nほし芋をくれた！(シンプルに)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなかんじ٩(｡•ω•｡)﻿و"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/07/22/1359314/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"～ランダム返し～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメント\n読みました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもありがとう♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しい言葉とか\nためになる話は\nすぐスクショしちゃう。\nいっぱいフォルダにたまってる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/07/22/1359314/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなに感謝***"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すきだよ"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-h799c029e77":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は朝から怒涛の１日だった"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanami.hashimoto/img/0000-217.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メイクがいつもとちがうのわかる？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーってやっぱりすごいなー、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仕事終わりにリハ行ったんだけど、\n一瞬見ただけで、「あれ？今日メイクちがう！」\nってみんな気付いてくれた( ･⊝･ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今はまいやんと明日の仕事現場に向かってるよん\n朝早いから泊まりなんだー！\nあしたもあさからがんばるぞー！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って、昨日打って送ったと思ってたら送らさってなかった、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃねむいです、おやすみ、っていいたいけどおはようだし今からがんばらなきゃ\nきょうも１日長いけどがんばるぞぅぅ"}],"source":"archive"}}